# Open a password reset link. Start the API with Aspire first. A real token is in the email in Mailpit.
@host = http://localhost:5279

### Unknown token → 200, with a page that opens the reset password screen.
GET {{host}}/links/reset-password?token=not-a-real-token

### No token → 200, with the same page.
GET {{host}}/links/reset-password
